# The Workshop gallery of this mod, in the order it is uploaded (0- is the copy of the Preview, then gallery-1 to gallery-7).
# RESTAGED 2026-10-15, REWRITTEN 2026-10-23 after /rate-gallery (series mean 1.6 of 5): the plan broke GALLERY.md "Shotlist" on d (a bun under a hat,
# one outfit in all seven shots), b (no decor named), e (Nelim only standing), h (no risk written), i (shot 2 was an arc of beasts facing the camera)
# and c (shot 7 had no living thing). Now: Nelim, the protagonist (owner rule 2026-10-14), changes outfit, hair and action in every shot; hair under
# a hat is long and loose (Roo_Royal_LongHD, her "under a hat" hair in SanctuaryBacklot/docs/NELIM-PROFIL.md, never a bun), hair without a hat is her
# canon high ponytail (Roo_HD_Hair_Highpony); Show Hair Under Stuff (in the pass map) keeps the hair visible under the Taoist hat; every shot places
# named decor that is removed after it; every shot writes its risk and the plan against it.
#
# THE STORY. One New Year's day at Nelim's Sanctuary, told like a wildlife report on four beasts out of the Classic of Mountains and Seas that came
# with the holiday, and the rooster that announces the day. Nelim is the keeper; Ren (silver hair, crimson duster, crimson eyes) is the only guest, a
# hunter, in the two images that need someone to shoot or to be shaken. Each picture is an encounter, never a row. Rhythm: one shot every two hours of
# game time from 6 h to 18 h (shot 7 goes back to noon, indoors); the light walks from cold blue dawn to red dusk; time is paused before any pawn is
# placed so that nobody walks away. Palette of Nelim (NELIM-PROFIL.md): emerald, deep blue, brown, beige, blood red, gold, orange accent.
#
# SHOT PLAN (place, hour, subject, composition, living, decor, Nelim, action, risk and plan):
#  1  6 h  statue garden. Subject: Nelim feeds the hens while the Pleiades star officer crows among the statues. Composition: zoom 5, cell (155,97),
#          rooster and hen face South at mid-ground, Nelim off-centre left, a tall daylily in the foreground, low cold sun. Living: rooster, hen.
#          Decor: Plant_Daylily fully grown at (153,99) and (157,99), TorchLamp lit at (151,95) as the one warm light of the dawn.
#          Nelim: deep blue middle robe (24,52,110), Taoist hat, long loose hair. Action: carries Kibble, feeding. Face cheerful.
#          Risk: the chickens wander off the cell. Plan: they are spawned after the pause, so nothing moves.
#  2 10 h  south enclosure. Subject: the four beasts at the gate for the New Year. Composition: zoom 9, cell (151,213), the beasts at four different
#          depths (z 212 to 219) and facings (three South, the nian beast West), not a row and not an arc, Nelim in the left foreground. Living: four
#          beasts. Decor: Brazier lit at (146,207) and (162,207), the New Year fires of the gate. Nelim: emerald gilded dragon robe (RI_Apparel_DragonRobe),
#          no hat, ponytail. Action: carries Hay, offering it over the gate, facing East. Face cheerful.
#          Risk: the four bodies overlap or one leaves the frame. Plan: the offsets of 3 to 8 cells are measured on the empty enclosure photograph.
#  3 12 h  gravel yard. Subject: the qiongqi, face to the camera, has picked its target; Nelim braces behind sandbags. Composition: zoom 6, cell (170,143),
#          qiongqi at the back, sandbags at the front, Nelim off-centre. Living: qiongqi. Decor: Sandbags at (171,143) and (172,143). Nelim: brown
#          middle robe (122,84,52), SanShan hat, long loose hair. Action: carries Gun_BoltActionRifle, watchful. Face WaitCombat.
#          Risk: the flight cannot be caught in a frame (feature 21 proves it). Plan: the shot is the moment before, as the subtitle says.
#  4 14 h  bare clearing. Subject: the nian beast breathes fire at a muffalo, Nelim holds the firecracker. Composition: zoom 7, cell (194,150), flame
#          across the frame, Nelim at the left edge. Living: nian beast, muffalo. Decor: Plant_Daylily fully grown at (188,146), (189,147). Nelim:
#          burnt orange gilded dragon robe, no hat, ponytail. Action: carries SZ_Firecracker. Face cheerful.
#          Risk: the flame is gone at the capture. Plan: the step asserts SZ_YearBeastFlame, then pauses.
#  5 16 h  gravel yard. Subject: the mingshe's wind barrier throws back Ren's shot, Nelim watches with a medicine kit. Composition: zoom 8, cell
#          (173,143), the projectile in flight between Ren and the mingshe. Living: mingshe, Ren. Decor: Sandbags at (181,143) as Ren's cover.
#          Nelim: crimson middle robe (150,34,40), Taoist hat, long loose hair. Action: carries MedicineHerbal. Face wary. Ren: hard-eyed.
#          Risk: the barrier or the projectile fails (the 2026-10-13 red). Plan: the step asserts the projectile in flight; replay of feature 20 first.
#  6 18 h  water garden. Subject: the sexie's red aura drives Ren berserk, Nelim at the edge of the ring. Composition: zoom 8, cell (147,171), the ring
#          around the beast, Ren inside. Living: sexie, Ren. Decor: TorchLamp lit at (139,166) and (141,175), the dusk light. Nelim: gilded dragon
#          robe, no hat, long loose hair. Action: backs away. Face afraid.
#          Risk: the cell where Nelim stands is not standable (the 2026-10-18 red at (137,169)). Plan: she stands at (141,170); if the step fails the
#          log names the cell, move her one cell, do not cut the shot.
#  7 12 h  postindustrial workshop. Subject: Nelim at the gene extractor, three archite capsules, a hen under the bench. Composition: zoom 7, cell
#          (230,213), the machine in the centre, capsules in a row of the machine itself (props, not subjects). Living: a hen, daylilies. Decor: three
#          ArchiteCapsule, Plant_Daylily at (227,215) and (233,215), four TorchLamp lit around the bench (the roof stays: GALLERY.md, "Éclairer un lieu
#          sombre"). Nelim: beige inside-shirt (230,218,190) with long pants, Taoist hat, long loose hair. Action: carries ArchiteCapsule. Face cheerful.
#          Risk: the room is too dark with its roof. Plan: four lit torches; if still dark, report to Pickle Tools, do not remove the roof.
#
# Every scenario is @review: a green run proves a picture was taken, not that it is worth uploading. Open every capture before keeping it,
# and drop one that shows the launcher, the log viewer, a dev-mode bar, a pawn or an animal of another mod, or an empty frame; what comes
# from the scene or the shared tool is reported to Pickle Tools (via the Ticket Manager if unreachable). The size limit of the page (owner,
# 2026-10-06): each image under 2 MB, all together under 8 MB. Subtitles: PUBLICATION.md, "Gallery subtitles".
#
# Steps: the places and their cleaning, and Nelim's own face, are Nelim's Sanctuary steps (SanctuaryBacklot); the generic tools (presentation
# mode, framing, bodies, clothes, ticks, decor, the facial expression) are Nelim's Pickle Tools steps; the beasts and the capture are this suite's own.
# Run under wsl-deps.sanctuary.map (the Backlot's minimum list plus Chinese Comprehensive Expansion, RimImmortal and Roo's HD Hairstyles), which makes
# the feature skip itself in every other pass.
